[Bryce]<i> Tyler.</i>

804
00:43:50.586 --> 00:43:52.626
<i>It's Bryce... Walker.</i>

805
00:43:53.673 --> 00:43:57.553
<i>Listen. that thing we talked about.
I'm dealing with it.</i>

806
00:43:57.969 --> 00:44:00.179
<i>You're all good.
Take care of yourself. man.</i>

807
